{"name": "One Hit Hero", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One hit is all it takes. Enter a sealed dungeon where every boss stands between you and freedom, and any hit is fatal, for you and your foes alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MASTER YOUR DEFENSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read attacks, block, parry, and dodge to build your Resolve. Perfectly timed parries bring you closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/0f95f90b5e3e992991380fd94ee89474.poster.avif?t=1793635397\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/0f95f90b5e3e992991380fd94ee89474.webm?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/0f95f90b5e3e992991380fd94ee89474.mp4?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">PROVE YOURSELF. EARN YOUR ESCAPE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore connected hubs and face bosses with distinct attack patterns and arena mechanics. Defeat them all to unseal your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/65eeebf0c8243fde0416b32cd52db24b.poster.avif?t=1793635397\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/65eeebf0c8243fde0416b32cd52db24b.webm?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/65eeebf0c8243fde0416b32cd52db24b.mp4?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">EARN THE KILLING BLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the onslaught, fill your Resolve, and unleash a single decisive strike. No chipping away at health bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/427b1a1af16ce6199849dcf572781420.poster.avif?t=1793635397\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/427b1a1af16ce6199849dcf572781420.webm?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/427b1a1af16ce6199849dcf572781420.mp4?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distinct bosses and arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent passive perk unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard, mouse, and controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/01984bd60d59f4e739f24e1157469c84.poster.avif?t=1793635397\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/01984bd60d59f4e739f24e1157469c84.webm?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/extras/01984bd60d59f4e739f24e1157469c84.mp4?t=1793635397\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "One Hit Hero is a boss-rush action game where any hit is fatal, for you and your foes alike. Read attack patterns, block, parry, and dodge to build the power to slay each boss with one decisive strike. Trapped in a sealed dungeon, you must prove yourself by defeating every boss to earn your escape.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5228430/453e31a23fbc4b26826c6b9606f3cf217aa01028/header.jpg?t=1793635397", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Boss Rush", "Souls-like", "Action", "Difficult", "Adventure", "Action-Adventure"], "developers": "Glitch Pixel Interactive, Low Tech Studios", "publishers": "Glitch Pixel Interactive, Low Tech Studios", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5228430", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uBLerwglGDk", "first_seen": 1793574000.0, "review_rank": 32}